<title>UK: Kvaerner 96 pretax profit drops.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner 96 pretax profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (crowns)		   19.87	    vs 40.78</p>
<p> Operating profit	     1,030	    vs 1,900</p>
<p> Shipbuilding pretax profit 1,027	    vs 1,524</p>
<p> Gp pretax profit	     750		vs 2,435</p>
<p> Turnover			 58,600	   vs 30,200</p>
<p> Net order reserves	   67,900	   vs 32,900</p>
<p> New orders		     50,000	   vs 23,400</p>
<p>NOTE - Group pretax profit figure includes profit on the sale of ships of 344 million crowns and 466 million from the sale of other assets, Kvaerner said. The statement was released in London.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
